  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Best for Dry, Combo, Normal Skin</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A sheer and hydrating water-based blush in a Korean-inspired cushion compact for a buildable, weightless wash of natural, skin-like color.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> It is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This skincare-infused, water-based blush melts seamlessly into skin for a dewy, fresh glow. The Korean-made cushion compact allows effortless, buildable application without streaking or patching. Pair it with the REFY Duo Brush 2.0 (sold separately) for seamless blending. This blush is lightweight, breathable, and designed for real life to enhance skin without looking like makeup.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Using the REFY Duo Brush 2.0 (sold separately) or a fluffy blush brush, gently press into the cushion to release the formula.<br>-Build onto the cheeks and sweep across the nose for a natural, sunkissed flush.<br>-Firmly close the inner lid after each use to keep the formula fresh.<br>-TIP: If the cushion feels drier over time, gently press down on the sponge to help release more formula from within.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Aqua/Water/Eau, Phenyl Trimethicone, Glycerin, Dimethicone, Diphenylsiloxy Phenyl Trimethicone, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Methyl Trimethicone, Isododecane, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Cetyl PEG/PPG-10/1 Dimethicone, Lauryl PEG-9 Polydimethylsiloxyethyl Dimethicone, Acrylates/Polytrimethylsiloxymethacrylate Copolymer, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Magnesium Sulfate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Triolein, Silica, Glyceryl Dioleate, Ceramide NP, Aluminum Hydroxide, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Butylene Glycol, Tocopherol, Camellia Sinensis Leaf (Green Tea) Extract, Phenoxyethanol [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Red 7 Lake (CI 15850), Yellow 5 Lake (CI 19140), Red 30 Lake (CI 73360), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)].</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Best for Dry, Combo, Normal Skin</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A sheer and hydrating water-based blush in a Korean-inspired cushion compact for a buildable, weightless wash of natural, skin-like color.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> It is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This skincare-infused, water-based blush melts seamlessly into skin for a dewy, fresh glow. The Korean-made cushion compact allows effortless, buildable application without streaking or patching. Pair it with the REFY Duo Brush 2.0 (sold separately) for seamless blending. This blush is lightweight, breathable, and designed for real life to enhance skin without looking like makeup.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Using the REFY Duo Brush 2.0 (sold separately) or a fluffy blush brush, gently press into the cushion to release the formula.<br>-Build onto the cheeks and sweep across the nose for a natural, sunkissed flush.<br>-Firmly close the inner lid after each use to keep the formula fresh.<br>-TIP: If the cushion feels drier over time, gently press down on the sponge to help release more formula from within.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Aqua/Water/Eau, Phenyl Trimethicone, Glycerin, Dimethicone, Diphenylsiloxy Phenyl Trimethicone, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Methyl Trimethicone, Isododecane, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Cetyl PEG/PPG-10/1 Dimethicone, Lauryl PEG-9 Polydimethylsiloxyethyl Dimethicone, Acrylates/Polytrimethylsiloxymethacrylate Copolymer, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Magnesium Sulfate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Triolein, Silica, Glyceryl Dioleate, Ceramide NP, Aluminum Hydroxide, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Butylene Glycol, Tocopherol, Camellia Sinensis Leaf (Green Tea) Extract, Phenoxyethanol [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Red 7 Lake (CI 15850), Yellow 5 Lake (CI 19140), Red 30 Lake (CI 73360), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)].</div></details>",
